{"kind": "mod", "id": 1918, "name": "Plastic card.", "slug": "plastic-card", "teaser": "A pile of dirty cash takes up a lot of storage space ?", "owner_name": "Local Crew", "downloads": 4117, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "The Unlicense", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:02:37.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-12-25T12:39:44.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-12-25T12:39:44.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.10.0", "latest_version": "1.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/unlicense/", "description_html": "<p>Are you a professional assassin who takes out <strong>7-8</strong> <strong>PMC</strong> dog tags from a raid and diligently performs all elimination quests</p>\n<p>A homeboy who stamps <strong>bitcoins</strong> and sells them to a fence collecting a huge pile of cash ?</p>\n<p>Or are you just a <strong>mod maker</strong> who needs to keep a lot of money in the hiding place ?</p>\n<p><strong>Was it ?</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/iJN7XQv.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iJN7XQv.png\" alt=\"iJN7XQv.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>Well, it’s time to keep your cash in one place, and that place is a debit plastic card.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/lZ3DRRE.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lZ3DRRE.png\" alt=\"lZ3DRRE.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>The script simply replaces the game currency model, so after installation, you’ll have to collect all the cards into one.</p>\n<p>Since the game has a trader who uses <strong>GP coins</strong>, the script changes the size of the stack of <strong>GP coins</strong> to the maximum, as well as changes their model to a secure flash drive.</p>\n<p><strong>GP coin</strong> model changes can be enabled or disabled in the file <strong>config.json</strong>.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/NTXgEOq.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NTXgEOq.png\" alt=\"NTXgEOq.png\" /></a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 4117, "published_at": "2024-12-25T12:39:44.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1918/plastic-card/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": [], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J5xRkdRt8rBgIkuFyfDkROim84PbxhYu/view?usp=sharing", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": true, "obtainable": false, "dep_problems": 0}